Read our reviews on Google \\u2192</a></div>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"1d3eeb3\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"abca263\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"in split\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Our mission</div>\\n      <h2>All of your cycling needs at your fingertips</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"lede\\\">Since its founding in 2016, Cigala Cycling\\u2019s mission is to bring all of the cyclist\\u2019s needs in one place and make them easily available at your fingertips.</p>\\n      <p>Cigala Cycling was founded by Matteo Cigala when he moved from Italy to Ireland. A former pro cyclist with 28 years in the sport, he combines sports science, racing experience and close links with professional teams to help riders of every level train smarter and ride faster.</p>\\n      <ul class=\\\"creds\\\">\\n        <li>European Road Champion Gran Fondo</li>\\n        <li>UCI Gran Fondo Vice World Champion</li>\\n        <li>UCI Gravel Vice World Champion</li>\\n        <li>Italian Gravel Champion</li>\\n        <li>200+ race wins</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <p class=\\\"sig\\\">Matteo Cigala<span>Head Coach &amp; Tours Director</span></p>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"/about/\\\">Read our story \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"photo\\\"><img src=\\\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/matteo-cigala-white-jersey.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Matteo Cigala, former pro cyclist and founder of Cigala Cycling, in the white Cigala Cycling jersey\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"0849944\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"73398b0\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"rv-head\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Our riders</div>\\n        <h2>What our riders say</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"rv-links\\\"><a class=\\\"g-rev\\\" href=\\\"https://share.google/lwboSfcuStGhX0c0p\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u2605</span> Read our reviews on Google \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"rv-wrap\\\"><div class=\\\"rv-row\\\" id=\\\"rv-row\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rider reviews, scroll sideways\\\"><figure class=\\\"rv\\\"><div class=\\\"rv-top\\\"><span class=\\\"rv-tag\\\">Coaching</span><div class=\\\"rv-stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 stars\\\">\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\\u201cHe has not only made me fall in love with cycling, but has believed in me even when I didn\\u2019t. As I speak, I am current European Gran Fondo &amp; gravel 19-34 champion, silver medalist at the Gran Fondo Worlds, from only starting cycling last February this year.\\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\\\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-marine-lenehan.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Female cyclist biting gold medal\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\"><div><b>Marine Lenehan</b><span>Now a WorldTour Pro \\u00b7 Ireland</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\\\"rv\\\"><div class=\\\"rv-top\\\"><span class=\\\"rv-tag\\\">Bike tours</span><div class=\\\"rv-stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 stars\\\">\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\\u201cHad a wonderful tour with Cigala in the French Alps in June 2025. I just showed up ready to pedal and they took care of the rest: excellent rental bikes, phenomenal routes with stunning views, gracious accommodations and delicious food with local charm. As an added bonus, Matteo captures the action with amazing photos.\\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\\\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-hank.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cycling Alps Cigala Cycling\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\"><div><b>Hank</b><span>USA \\u00b7 French Alps</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\\\"rv\\\"><div class=\\\"rv-top\\\"><span class=\\\"rv-tag\\\">Coaching</span><div class=\\\"rv-stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 stars\\\">\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\\u201cWith his expertise, support, and personalized approach, I have achieved my goal of qualifying for the UCI Granfondo World Championship.\\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\\\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-bernd-ondruch.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cycling Pro wearing Kask helmet\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\"><div><b>Bernd Ondruch</b><span>Germany &amp; UK</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\\\"rv\\\"><div class=\\\"rv-top\\\"><span class=\\\"rv-tag\\\">Bike tours</span><div class=\\\"rv-stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"5 stars\\\">\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\\u201cThis was my first cycling trip, and I was depending on Cigala Tours to make it a good one. They did not disappoint. Matteo, Marine and company were fantastic, putting together a great itinerary and making sure that everyone had a wonderful time. And if you haven\\u2019t been to Lake Garda, you have to go; it\\u2019s beautiful.\\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\\\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-steve.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Person smiling while riding a celeste-colored Bianchi road bicycle\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\"><div><b>Steve</b><span>Canada \\u00b7 Lake Garda</span></div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\\\"rv-nav\\\"><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"rv-btn\\\" data-d=\\\"-1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Previous reviews\\\">\\u2190</button><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"rv-btn\\\" data-d=\\\"1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Next reviews\\\">\\u2192</button></div></div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"b93c31d\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"a45ab3e\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"band\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-group-black-kit.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cigala Cycling riders in the black team kit\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Get in touch</div>\\n        <h2>Questions about coaching, tours or an order?</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-lines\\\">\\n          <div><span>Email</span>info@cigalacycling.com</div>\\n          <div><span>Phone</span>+353 404 78107</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"ctas\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"/contact/\\\">Contact us \\u2192</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/message/WVBRO6XAMQMCH1\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">WhatsApp</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n<script>(function(){var l=document.querySelectorAll('.proof b');if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;\\nl.forEach(function(el){var m=el.textContent.match(/^([\\\\d,]+)(\\\\D*)$/);if(!m)return;var to=+m[1].replace(/,/g,''),suf=m[2],fmt=function(v){return v.toLocaleString('en-US')+suf;};el.style.minWidth=el.offsetWidth+'px';el.textContent=fmt(0);\\nnew IntersectionObserver(function(es,ob){if(!es[0].isIntersecting)return;ob.disconnect();var t0=performance.now();(function f(t){var k=Math.min(1,(t-t0)/1500);el.textContent=fmt(Math.round(to*(1-Math.pow(1-k,3))));if(k<1)requestAnimationFrame(f);})(t0);},{threshold:.5}).observe(el);});})();</script>\\n<script>(function(){var r=document.getElementById('rv-row');if(!r)return;var red=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\\nfunction go(d){var max=r.scrollWidth-r.clientWidth;if(d>0&&r.scrollLeft>=max-4){r.scrollTo({left:0,behavior:red?'auto':'smooth'});return;}r.scrollBy({left:d*r.clientWidth*0.85,behavior:red?'auto':'smooth'});}\\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.rv-btn').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){stop=true;go(+b.dataset.d);});});\\n/* Matteo 15 Nov: the reviews move on slowly by themselves; they stop while you hover, touch or use the arrows */\\nvar stop=red,hold=false;['mouseenter','focusin','touchstart'].forEach(function(e){r.addEventListener(e,function(){hold=true;},{passive:true});});\\n['mouseleave','focusout'].forEach(function(e){r.addEventListener(e,function(){hold=false;});});r.addEventListener('touchstart',function(){stop=true;},{passive:true});\\nvar vis=false;if('IntersectionObserver' in window)new IntersectionObserver(function(es){vis=es[0].isIntersecting;}).observe(r);\\nsetInterval(function(){if(!stop&&!hold&&vis&&!document.hidden)go(1);},5000);})();</script>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}]", "_elementor_edit_mode": "builder"}, "content": "<div class=\"hero hero-photo\">\n  <img class=\"hero-bg\" src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-cycling-hero-mountain-hairpins-1200.webp\" srcset=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-cycling-hero-mountain-hairpins-1200.webp 1200w, https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-cycling-hero-mountain-hairpins.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"Aerial view of a winding mountain road with hairpin bends\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1152\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"eyebrow eyebrow-pill\">Cigala Cycling</div>\n      <h1>Cycling &amp; Triathlon Coaching, Bike Tours &amp; Retail</h1>\n      <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Whether it is to help you improve your cycling and triathlon abilities, to give you the most unforgettable bike tour or to help you shop the right product, Cigala Cycling has you covered.</p>\n      <div class=\"ctas\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Coaching \u2192</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bike tours</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"since\"><b>2016</b>Founded in Ireland</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"in proof-wrap\"><div class=\"proof\" aria-label=\"Cigala Cycling in numbers\">\n    <div><b>1,000+</b><span>Athletes coached worldwide</span></div>\n    <div><b>700+</b><span>Cyclists guided on tour</span></div>\n    <div><b>10+</b><span>Years running tours</span></div>\n    <div><b>10+</b><span>Years serving customers in Ireland &amp; Europe</span></div>\n  </div><a class=\"g-rev\" href=\"https://share.google/lwboSfcuStGhX0c0p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2605</span> Read our reviews on Google \u2192</a></div>\n</div>\n<section style=\"padding-top:40px\">\n  <div class=\"in biz\">\n    <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-coaching-riders.webp\" alt=\"Three Cigala Cycling riders climbing a mountain road together\">\n      <div class=\"tx\">\n        <span class=\"k\">Train smarter, ride faster</span>\n        <h2>Cycling &amp; Triathlon Coaching</h2>\n        <p>Individual, sportive and group coaching from a former pro with 28 years in cycling. Over 1,000 athletes coached worldwide.</p>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-go\">Go to coaching site \u2192</span>\n        <span class=\"host\">coaching.cigalacycling.com</span>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-riders-cyprus-card.webp\" alt=\"Cigala Cycling Tours riders in white team jerseys celebrating on the coast in Cyprus\">\n      <div class=\"tx\">\n        <span class=\"k\">Guided road &amp; gravel tours</span>\n        <h2>Tours</h2>\n        <p>Fully supported trips across Europe for over a decade, with 700+ cyclists guided. Official tour operator of top Gran Fondos.</p>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-go\">Go to tours site \u2192</span>\n        <span class=\"host\">tours.cigalacycling.com</span>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://retail.cigalacycling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-retail-smart-bike.webp\" alt=\"Rider training on a Wahoo smart bike in front of a mountain backdrop\">\n      <div class=\"tx\">\n        <span class=\"k\">Ireland's #1 online cycling store</span>\n        <h2>Retail Store</h2>\n        <p>A superb range of cycling and triathlon products, trusted for 10 years by cyclists and athletes in Ireland and across Europe.</p>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-go\">Go to retail store \u2192</span>\n        <span class=\"host\">retail.cigalacycling.com</span>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n  <div class=\"in proof-mob\"><div class=\"proof\" aria-label=\"Cigala Cycling in numbers\">\n    <div><b>1,000+</b><span>Athletes coached worldwide</span></div>\n    <div><b>700+</b><span>Cyclists guided on tour</span></div>\n    <div><b>10+</b><span>Years running tours</span></div>\n    <div><b>10+</b><span>Years serving customers in Ireland &amp; Europe</span></div>\n  </div><a class=\"g-rev\" href=\"https://share.google/lwboSfcuStGhX0c0p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2605</span> Read our reviews on Google \u2192</a></div>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in split\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Our mission</div>\n      <h2>All of your cycling needs at your fingertips</h2>\n      <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Since its founding in 2016, Cigala Cycling\u2019s mission is to bring all of the cyclist\u2019s needs in one place and make them easily available at your fingertips.</p>\n      <p>Cigala Cycling was founded by Matteo Cigala when he moved from Italy to Ireland. A former pro cyclist with 28 years in the sport, he combines sports science, racing experience and close links with professional teams to help riders of every level train smarter and ride faster.</p>\n      <ul class=\"creds\">\n        <li>European Road Champion Gran Fondo</li>\n        <li>UCI Gran Fondo Vice World Champion</li>\n        <li>UCI Gravel Vice World Champion</li>\n        <li>Italian Gravel Champion</li>\n        <li>200+ race wins</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"sig\">Matteo Cigala<span>Head Coach &amp; Tours Director</span></p>\n      <div class=\"ctas\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/about/\">Read our story \u2192</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo\"><img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/matteo-cigala-white-jersey.webp\" alt=\"Matteo Cigala, former pro cyclist and founder of Cigala Cycling, in the white Cigala Cycling jersey\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"rv-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Our riders</div>\n        <h2>What our riders say</h2>\n        <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rv-links\"><a class=\"g-rev\" href=\"https://share.google/lwboSfcuStGhX0c0p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2605</span> Read our reviews on Google \u2192</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rv-wrap\"><div class=\"rv-row\" id=\"rv-row\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Rider reviews, scroll sideways\"><figure class=\"rv\"><div class=\"rv-top\"><span class=\"rv-tag\">Coaching</span><div class=\"rv-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\u201cHe has not only made me fall in love with cycling, but has believed in me even when I didn\u2019t. As I speak, I am current European Gran Fondo &amp; gravel 19-34 champion, silver medalist at the Gran Fondo Worlds, from only starting cycling last February this year.\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-marine-lenehan.webp\" alt=\"Female cyclist biting gold medal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><div><b>Marine Lenehan</b><span>Now a WorldTour Pro \u00b7 Ireland</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rv\"><div class=\"rv-top\"><span class=\"rv-tag\">Bike tours</span><div class=\"rv-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\u201cHad a wonderful tour with Cigala in the French Alps in June 2025. I just showed up ready to pedal and they took care of the rest: excellent rental bikes, phenomenal routes with stunning views, gracious accommodations and delicious food with local charm. As an added bonus, Matteo captures the action with amazing photos.\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-hank.webp\" alt=\"Cycling Alps Cigala Cycling\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><div><b>Hank</b><span>USA \u00b7 French Alps</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rv\"><div class=\"rv-top\"><span class=\"rv-tag\">Coaching</span><div class=\"rv-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\u201cWith his expertise, support, and personalized approach, I have achieved my goal of qualifying for the UCI Granfondo World Championship.\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-bernd-ondruch.webp\" alt=\"Cycling Pro wearing Kask helmet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><div><b>Bernd Ondruch</b><span>Germany &amp; UK</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rv\"><div class=\"rv-top\"><span class=\"rv-tag\">Bike tours</span><div class=\"rv-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div></div><blockquote>\u201cThis was my first cycling trip, and I was depending on Cigala Tours to make it a good one. They did not disappoint. Matteo, Marine and company were fantastic, putting together a great itinerary and making sure that everyone had a wonderful time. And if you haven\u2019t been to Lake Garda, you have to go; it\u2019s beautiful.\u201d</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-review-steve.webp\" alt=\"Person smiling while riding a celeste-colored Bianchi road bicycle\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"><div><b>Steve</b><span>Canada \u00b7 Lake Garda</span></div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"rv-nav\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rv-btn\" data-d=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous reviews\">\u2190</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rv-btn\" data-d=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next reviews\">\u2192</button></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"band\">\n      <img src=\"https://staging.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-group-black-kit.webp\" alt=\"Cigala Cycling riders in the black team kit\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"tx\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Get in touch</div>\n        <h2>Questions about coaching, tours or an order?</h2>\n        <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n        <div class=\"contact-lines\">\n          <div><span>Email</span>info@cigalacycling.com</div>\n          <div><span>Phone</span>+353 404 78107</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ctas\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact us \u2192</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://wa.me/message/WVBRO6XAMQMCH1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<script>(function(){var l=document.querySelectorAll('.proof b');if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;\nl.forEach(function(el){var m=el.textContent.match(/^([\\d,]+)(\\D*)$/);if(!m)return;var to=+m[1].replace(/,/g,''),suf=m[2],fmt=function(v){return v.toLocaleString('en-US')+suf;};el.style.minWidth=el.offsetWidth+'px';el.textContent=fmt(0);\nnew IntersectionObserver(function(es,ob){if(!es[0].isIntersecting)return;ob.disconnect();var t0=performance.now();(function f(t){var k=Math.min(1,(t-t0)/1500);el.textContent=fmt(Math.round(to*(1-Math.pow(1-k,3))));if(k<1)requestAnimationFrame(f);})(t0);},{threshold:.5}).observe(el);});})();</script>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.getElementById('rv-row');if(!r)return;var red=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\nfunction go(d){var max=r.scrollWidth-r.clientWidth;if(d>0&&r.scrollLeft>=max-4){r.scrollTo({left:0,behavior:red?'auto':'smooth'});return;}r.scrollBy({left:d*r.clientWidth*0.85,behavior:red?'auto':'smooth'});}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.rv-btn').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){stop=true;go(+b.dataset.d);});});\n/* Matteo 15 Nov: the reviews move on slowly by themselves; they stop while you hover, touch or use the arrows */\nvar stop=red,hold=false;['mouseenter','focusin','touchstart'].forEach(function(e){r.addEventListener(e,function(){hold=true;},{passive:true});});\n['mouseleave','focusout'].forEach(function(e){r.addEventListener(e,function(){hold=false;});});r.addEventListener('touchstart',function(){stop=true;},{passive:true});\nvar vis=false;if('IntersectionObserver' in window)new IntersectionObserver(function(es){vis=es[0].isIntersecting;}).observe(r);\nsetInterval(function(){if(!stop&&!hold&&vis&&!document.hidden)go(1);},5000);})();</script>"}